  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4602.53 Minimum reserve price",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-03-30",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4602.53 “Minimum reserve price” means the minimum price for each CO2 allowance in a specific auction as follows:\n\n(a) In calendar year 2014, $2.00; and\n\n(b) In each calendar year thereafter, 1.025 multiplied by the minimum reserve price from the previous calendar year, rounded to the nearest whole cent.\n\nSource. #9283, INTERIM, eff 10-1-08, EXPIRED: 3-30-09\n\nNew. #9444, eff 4-3-09; ss by #10468, eff 1-1-14 (from Env-A 4602.49); ss by #12967, eff 1-1-20 (from Env-A 4602.54)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a4600.html"
